WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.061
Your clients keep asking what you're doing
with AI.

2
00:00:03.211 --> 00:00:05.113
And you don't have the engineers to build
it.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.190
So sell it under your own name.

4
00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:13.445
We design it, build it and run it,
quietly, behind you.

5
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.069
First, one or two calls.

6
00:00:18.219 --> 00:00:21.016
We learn about your clients and what
they're asking for,

7
00:00:21.016 --> 00:00:22.614
and pick the model that fits.

8
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.183
Then, over one to two weeks,

9
00:00:26.183 --> 00:00:30.688
we put the agreement in writing and
prepare a sales kit with your logo on it.

10
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.449
Next, we build your client's system under
your brand and on your domain.

11
00:00:37.599 --> 00:00:39.513
Your team is part of every review.

12
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.339
After launch, we keep it running.

13
00:00:45.489 --> 00:00:50.183
Your client sees only your brand, and the
relationship stays yours, in writing.

14
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:55.085
Fully white label, delivered together, or
a simple referral.

15
00:00:55.235 --> 00:00:56.784
You decide how much we show.

16
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.518
Got an AI request on your desk?

17
00:01:00.668 --> 00:01:01.901
Book a partner call.

